title: XCalib
abstract: "Camera-LiDAR cross-modal matching for edge devices: pretrained
  matchers, targetless calibration, ONNX/TensorRT export, training, one-shot
  adaptation, a review GUI, and a delivery-to-scene annotation workflow with a
  pair-fitted homography."
